window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>FIREWALKERS ARE BRAVE. FIREWALKERS ARE RESOURCEFUL. FIREWALKERS ARE EXPENDABLE.<br><br>The Earth is burning. Nothing can survive at the Anchor; not without water and power. But the ultra-rich, waiting for their ride off the dying Earth? They can buy water. And thanks to their investment, the sun can provide power.<br><br>But someone has to repair the solar panels when they fail, down in the deserts below.<br><br>Kids like Mao, and Lupé, and Hotep; kids with brains and guts but no hope.The Firewalkers.<br><br>(P) Penguin Audio and Rebellion Publishing 2020</p>"; 
